      "id": "sol.amc-10a-2016-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Rewrite all bases as powers of \\(10\\): \\[\\small 10^x\\cdot100^{2x}=10^x\\cdot(10^2)^{2x}=10^{5x},\\] and \\[1000^5=(10^3)^5=10^{15}.\\]\n\nTherefore \\(5x=15\\), so \\(x=3\\).\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
